<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="矩形 4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{B53BD423-CE80-7E16-1680-FE69CC878096}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="12192000" cy="990600"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="004F88"/></a:solidFill></p:spPr><p:style><a:lnRef idx="2"><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:shade val="15000"/></a:schemeClr></a:lnRef><a:fillRef idx="1"><a:schemeClr val="accent1"/></a:fillRef><a:effectRef idx="0"><a:schemeClr val="accent1"/></a:effectRef><a:fontRef idx="minor"><a:schemeClr val="lt1"/></a:fontRef></p:style><p:txBody><a:bodyPr rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="4400" dirty="0"/><a:t>  </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="4400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>研究動機</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="6" name="文字方塊 5"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{090DF3DE-B59A-D98F-B385-0150F69C02A0}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="381000" y="1143000"/><a:ext cx="11277600" cy="5324535"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="285750" indent="-285750" algn="l"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" b="0" i="0" u="none" strike="noStrike" baseline="0" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" b="0" i="0" u="none" strike="noStrike" baseline="0" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Fama &amp; French (1993) </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" b="0" i="0" u="none" strike="noStrike" baseline="0" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>提出三因子模型，將規模效應與價值效應納入資產定價模型，顯著提升對股報報酬率差異的解釋能力－依賴</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>先驗假設，忽略系統性風險來源探討</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" b="0" i="0" u="none" strike="noStrike" baseline="0" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>。</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" b="0" i="0" u="none" strike="noStrike" baseline="0" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>統計因子模型透過直接分析資產報酬的變異結構，找出潛在系統性風險因素，無需預先設定特定公司特徵。主成分分析（</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>PCA</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>）具備有效捕捉資產報酬共同變異的能力，在無套利條件下，它可作為 </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>APT </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>所假設潛在因子的</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>一致估計</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>，因此成為資產定價實證研究的重要工具。（</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Chamberlain &amp; Rothschild</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>，</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>1983</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>、 </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Connor &amp; </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0" err="1"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Korajczyk</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>，</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>1986 </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>）</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>傳統主成分分析（</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>PCA</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>）雖可有效捕捉資產報酬的共變異結構，但缺乏風險定價能力與定價誤差的控制，所萃取之因子常無法解釋橫斷面報酬。</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Lettau &amp; Pelger (2020) </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>提出的風險溢酬主成分分析（</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>RP-PCA</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>），引入風險溢酬捕捉框架，透過目標函數調整，納入橫斷面報酬誤差項與權重參數，能同時擬合時間序列共變異與橫斷面風險溢酬，顯著提升因子的經濟意涵與預測能力</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>。</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>凸非負矩陣分解（</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Convex Non-negative Matrix Factorization, convex-NMF</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>）為一種資產報酬分解方法，其非負與凸組合限制使得因子具備可解釋為實際投資組合的特性，提升了財務上的解釋力（</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Ding et al., 2010</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>）。</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr id="8" name="圖片 7"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{1A96B7B0-2595-18EF-0B29-1624E6FF3778}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvPicPr><a:picLocks noChangeAspect="1"/></p:cNvPicPr><p:nvPr/></p:nvPicPr><p:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId2"/><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></p:blipFill><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="11180260" y="41787"/><a:ext cx="990600" cy="932329"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr></p:pic></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="3547367438"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>